---
title: Sequence Diagrams — Market Data (AggregatorV3) and Borrowing Limit (ICreditPassport)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant WBA as WB Admin
    participant WB as WorldBankReserve
    participant NB as NationalBank
    participant LB as LocalBank
    participant FEED as Chainlink Price Feed
    participant SBT as ICreditPassport
    participant API as Backend API
    participant U as Borrower

    rect rgb(242,242,242)
        Note over WBA,U: (a) Hierarchical capital flow (USDC)
        WBA->>WB: allocateCapital(NB, amount_usdc)
        WB->>WB: require ratio ≥ min
        WB-->>NB: transfer USDC + emit CapitalAllocated
        NB->>NB: allocateCapital(LB, amount_usdc)
        NB-->>LB: transfer USDC + emit CapitalAllocated
        LB-->>API: Pool funded → loans available
    end

    rect rgb(226,226,226)
        Note over WBA,U: (b) Market data — AggregatorV3Interface 8-decimal BDT
        U->>API: GET /market
        API->>API: cache miss (10s TTL)?
        API->>FEED: latestRoundData() BDT/USD
        FEED-->>API: answer (8 decimals) · updatedAt
        API->>FEED: latestRoundData() USDC/USD
        FEED-->>API: stablecoin + FX rates
        API-->>U: USDC · BDT/USD · ETH/USD (cached)
    end

    rect rgb(210,210,210)
        Note over WBA,U: (c) Borrowing limit — ICreditPassport + rolling windows
        U->>API: POST /loans { amount_usdc, term }
        API->>SBT: getScore(wallet)
        SBT-->>API: riskTier · repaymentCount · hasDefault
        API->>API: Map tier → USDC ceiling<br/>(50/250/1k/5k/25k)
        API->>API: Rolling window · openLoans cap
        alt Pass
            API-->>U: Proceed to ML scoring
        else Fail
            API-->>U: BORROW_LIMIT_EXCEEDED
        end
    end
